    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/62fdc952b169b6736a42f0b166438192.avif?t=1752730080\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Quo Vadis Magic Academy.\u00a0<br>It's the study temple where future wizards study day and night, tirelessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, Iris Galtung, is suddenly called out by the headmaster of the academy.\u00a0<br>Iris is surprised by the sudden summons, and the Headmaster informs her...<br>\u201cYou failed your promotion exam a few days ago.\u201d She was shocked.\u00a0<br>Iris is an excellent student, competing for first and second place in the school year, and there is no way she could have failed the promotion exam.\u00a0<br>Confident in her performance on the test, Iris asks the headmaster if something is wrong,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the headmaster completely dismissed this possibility.<br>...Hence, a merciless choice of one or the other was given in front of Iris.\u00a0<br> \u201cDo you want to be my sex slave, or do you want to repeat the year?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/261c6a82f8d2e6bebcf9bf44acfd3b4e.avif?t=1752730080\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwilling to do so, Iris decides to go on a trip to find the crafting materials for the \u201cPhilosopher's Stone\u201d to prove her ability.<br>So she went on a journey with her childhood best friend Noel, and her slutty schoolmate Lynn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Iris be able to overcome the many hardships awaiting her on her journey and advance to be able to promote? Encounters new companions, disgusting men with dirty cocks, and monster sexual abuses await Iris and her companions...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/afc5305e7a0ca8ba5dacbb5ce48ec65f.avif?t=1752730080\" width=600 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About the Game\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/f5b9181b976a52b5c2715c6a0074fe56.avif?t=1752730080\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2This is a classic RPG that uses the skill tree system.\u00a0<br>In standard mode, you will encounter a situation where you can't rely on brute force,\u00a0<br>so you need to cooperate with your companions to beat the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/48d55cd76ea626f940f3e0f417d1a58d.avif?t=1752730080\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Basic Event CG x34.\u00a0<br>In addition to the events triggered by basic conversations,\u00a0<br>events can also be triggered by meeting conditions when fighting demons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/7ac3ddf05ffab8c9fd99ae4f173aa032.avif?t=1752730080\" width=600 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2Includes Side Characters, all of whom have erotic values.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2After beating the game, Recollection Room will be available to revisit all the events in the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2There are two levels of difficulty to choose from.\u00a0<br>You can enjoy the corresponding challenge in the standard mode!\u00a0<br>In casual mode, you can easily advance in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2In the playtest with all dialog skipped, it takes about 4 hours to beat the game.\u00a0<br>The actual play time for players is estimated to be around 6 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2The system in dialog skipping and automatic proceed is optimized.\u00a0<br>Automated conversations are great for playing while doing other things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Main Characters\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/738c4987f9902838ea5c7d5831227a63.avif?t=1752730080\" width=350 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Iris<br>Female Protaganist</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/565e152abbc72a6d6b5c0671d71b88a6.avif?t=1752730080\" width=350 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Noel<br>Iris's childhood friend and best friend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298500/extras/afec2ec5ca5b113a1d0d4f8f2e1c9d7d.avif?t=1752730080\" width=350 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b2 Lynn<br>Iris's junior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
